            "content": "The first Sneaker Pimps album, released in 1996. It includes the popular singles \"6 Underground\" and \"Spin Spin Sugar.\" \n\nDue to the immense success the album received, it was re-released in 1997 with an alternate cover and remixes in place of certain songs. This is known as the limited edition release. The first, 1996 vinyl release contains the original artwork with original, intended track order. The 2008, 2016 and 2020 vinyl re-releases contain the original artwork with the 1997, limited edition track order. This was an error at One Little Indian Records' end. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Sneaker+Pimps/Becoming+X\">Read more on Last.fm</a>. User-contributed text is available under the Creative Commons By-SA License; additional terms may apply.",
